#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid ""
"Lightweight multi-niche block theme, native for Gutenberg and Elementor. "
"One-click demos (free & pro) via the WPEssential Core plugin."
msgstr ""
"Tema de blocos leve e multinicho, nativo para Gutenberg e Elementor. Demos "
"com um clique (gratuitas e pro) pelo plugin WPEssential Core."

#. Author of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "WPEssential Team"
msgstr "Equipe WPEssential"

